#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The B<iswgraph> function is the wide-character equivalent of the "
#| "B<isgraph> function. It tests whether I<wc> is a wide character belonging "
#| "to the wide character class \"graph\"."
msgid ""
"The B<iswgraph>()  function is the wide-character equivalent of the "
"B<isgraph>(3)  function.  It tests whether I<wc> is a wide character "
"belonging to the wide-character class \"graph\"."
msgstr ""
"A função B<iswgraph> é a equivalente em caracteres largos para a função "
"B<isgraph>. Ela testa se I<wc> é um caractere largo pertencente à classe de "
"caracteres largos 'graph'."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The wide character class \"graph\" is a subclass of the wide character "
#| "class \"print\"."
msgid ""
"The wide-character class \"graph\" is a subclass of the wide-character class "
"\"print\"."
msgstr "A classe 'graph' é uma subclasse da classe 'print'."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Being a subclass of the wide character class \"print\", the wide "
#| "character class \"graph\" is disjoint from the wide character class "
#| "\"cntrl\"."
msgid ""
"Being a subclass of the wide-character class \"print\", the wide-character "
"class \"graph\" is disjoint from the wide-character class \"cntrl\"."
msgstr ""
"Sendo uma subclasse da classe 'print', a classe 'graph' é disjunta da classe "
"'cntrl'."

#.  Note: UNIX98 (susv2/xbd/locale.html) says that "graph" and "space" may
#.  have characters in common, except U+0020. But C99 (ISO/IEC 9899:1999
#.  section 7.25.2.1.10) says that "space" and "graph" are disjoint.
#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The wide character class \"graph\" is disjoint from the wide character "
#| "class \"space\" and therefore also disjoint from its subclass \"blank\"."
msgid ""
"The wide-character class \"graph\" is disjoint from the wide-character class "
"\"space\" and therefore also disjoint from its subclass \"blank\"."
msgstr ""
"A classe 'graph' é disjunta da classe 'space', e portanto, também disjunta "
"de sua subclasse 'blank'."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The wide character class \"graph\" contains all the wide characters from "
#| "the wide character class \"print\" except the space character. It "
#| "therefore contains the wide character classes \"alnum\" and \"punct\"."
msgid ""
"The wide-character class \"graph\" contains all the wide characters from the "
"wide-character class \"print\" except the space character.  It therefore "
"contains the wide-character classes \"alnum\" and \"punct\"."
msgstr ""
"A classe 'graph' contém todos os caracteres largos da classe 'print' exceto "
"o caractere de espaço. Ela contém, portanto, as classes 'alnum' e 'punct'."

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "RETURN VALUE"
msgstr "VALOR DE RETORNO"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The B<iswgraph> function returns non-zero if I<wc> is a wide character "
#| "belonging to the wide character class \"graph\". Otherwise it returns "
#| "zero."
msgid ""
"The B<iswgraph>()  function returns nonzero if I<wc> is a wide character "
"belonging to the wide-character class \"graph\".  Otherwise, it returns zero."
msgstr ""
"A função B<iswgraph> retorna um valor diferente de zero se I<wc> é um "
"caractere largo pertencente à classe 'graph'. Caso contrário, ela retorna "
"zero."

